            "kind": "observation"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "evidence:stativ",
      "text": "In front of the festival stage stands a tripod with the local paper's camera. It films every speech, with a timestamp, whether anyone wants to watch or not.",
      "mentions": [
